<%= l_ui_title_bar(
  title: "Form helper",
  breadcrumbs: [
    ["Home", root_path],
    ["Forms", forms_path]
  ]
) %>

<p class="mt-4">The <code>l_ui_form</code> helper renders a complete form from a record and a field configuration array. It handles labels, inputs, hints, validation errors, and the submit button.</p>

<h2 class="mt-8 l-ui-heading--section">Basic form</h2>

<p class="mt-4">Pass a record, an array of field hashes, and a submission URL. Field types are inferred from the model's column types when <code>as:</code> is not specified.</p>

<%= l_ui_form(@post, fields: [
      { attribute: :title, required: true },
      { attribute: :body, hint: "Supports plain text only" },
    ],
    url: "#") %>

<div class="mt-6" data-controller="l-ui--modal">
  <button class="l-ui-button l-ui-button--outline l-ui-button--small" data-action="l-ui--modal#open">View code</button>
  <dialog class="l-ui-modal" data-l-ui--modal-target="dialog" data-action="click->l-ui--modal#closeOnBackdrop" aria-labelledby="modal-form-basic-heading">
    <div class="l-ui-modal__header">
      <h3 id="modal-form-basic-heading">Basic form</h3>
      <button class="l-ui-button l-ui-button--icon" data-action="l-ui--modal#close" aria-label="Close">
        <%= image_tag "layered_ui/icon_close.svg", alt: "", class: "l-ui-icon l-ui-icon--sm", aria: { hidden: true } %>
      </button>
    </div>
    <div class="l-ui-modal__body">
      <pre class="l-ui-surface"><code>&lt;%= l_ui_form(@post, fields: [
      { attribute: :title, required: true },
      { attribute: :body, hint: "Supports plain text only" },
    ],
    url: posts_path) %&gt;</code></pre>
    </div>
  </dialog>
</div>

<h2 class="mt-8 l-ui-heading--section">All field types</h2>

<p class="mt-4">Use <code>as:</code> to explicitly set the field type. Supported types: <code>:string</code>, <code>:text</code>, <code>:email</code>, <code>:password</code>, <code>:number</code>, <code>:tel</code>, <code>:url</code>, <code>:search</code>, <code>:date</code>, <code>:datetime</code>, <code>:time</code>, <code>:month</code>, <code>:week</code>, <code>:color</code>, <code>:range</code>, <code>:file</code>, <code>:select</code>, <code>:combobox</code>, <code>:checkbox</code>, and <code>:hidden</code>. The form is automatically rendered as <code>multipart</code> when any field uses <code>:file</code>.</p>

<%= l_ui_form(@post, fields: [
      { attribute: :title, as: :string, required: true, placeholder: "Enter a title" },
      { attribute: :body, as: :text, hint: "A longer description" },
      { attribute: :user_id, as: :select, label: "Author",
        prompt: "Choose an author",
        collection: @users.map { |u| [u.name, u.id] } },
      { attribute: :title, as: :email, label: "Email" },
      { attribute: :title, as: :password, label: "Password" },
      { attribute: :user_id, as: :number, label: "Number" },
      { attribute: :title, as: :tel, label: "Telephone" },
      { attribute: :title, as: :url, label: "URL" },
      { attribute: :title, as: :search, label: "Search" },
      { attribute: :created_at, as: :date, label: "Date" },
      { attribute: :created_at, as: :datetime, label: "Datetime" },
      { attribute: :created_at, as: :time, label: "Time" },
      { attribute: :created_at, as: :month, label: "Month" },
      { attribute: :created_at, as: :week, label: "Week" },
      { attribute: :title, as: :color, label: "Color" },
      { attribute: :user_id, as: :range, label: "Range" },
      { attribute: :title, as: :file, label: "File" },
      { attribute: :user_id, as: :checkbox, label: "Checkbox" },
      { attribute: :user_id, as: :hidden },
    ],
    url: "#") %>

<div class="mt-6" data-controller="l-ui--modal">
  <button class="l-ui-button l-ui-button--outline l-ui-button--small" data-action="l-ui--modal#open">View code</button>
  <dialog class="l-ui-modal" data-l-ui--modal-target="dialog" data-action="click->l-ui--modal#closeOnBackdrop" aria-labelledby="modal-form-types-heading">
    <div class="l-ui-modal__header">
      <h3 id="modal-form-types-heading">All field types</h3>
      <button class="l-ui-button l-ui-button--icon" data-action="l-ui--modal#close" aria-label="Close">
        <%= image_tag "layered_ui/icon_close.svg", alt: "", class: "l-ui-icon l-ui-icon--sm", aria: { hidden: true } %>
      </button>
    </div>
    <div class="l-ui-modal__body">
      <pre class="l-ui-surface"><code>&lt;%= l_ui_form(@post, fields: [
      { attribute: :title, as: :string, required: true,
        placeholder: "Enter a title" },
      { attribute: :body, as: :text,
        hint: "A longer description" },
      { attribute: :user_id, as: :select, label: "Author",
        prompt: "Choose an author",
        collection: User.pluck(:name, :id) },
      { attribute: :email, as: :email },
      { attribute: :password, as: :password },
      { attribute: :age, as: :number },
      { attribute: :phone, as: :tel },
      { attribute: :website, as: :url },
      { attribute: :query, as: :search },
      { attribute: :starts_on, as: :date },
      { attribute: :starts_at, as: :datetime },
      { attribute: :starts_time, as: :time },
      { attribute: :starts_month, as: :month },
      { attribute: :starts_week, as: :week },
      { attribute: :tint, as: :color },
      { attribute: :volume, as: :range },
      { attribute: :avatar, as: :file },
      { attribute: :accepted, as: :checkbox },
      { attribute: :secret_id, as: :hidden },
    ],
    url: posts_path) %&gt;</code></pre>
    </div>
  </dialog>
</div>

<h2 class="mt-8 l-ui-heading--section">Combobox fields</h2>

<p class="mt-4">Use <code>as: :combobox</code> for a token select with type-ahead filtering. The field renders its own label and hint, and the current value of the attribute is selected by default. Every <code>l_ui_combobox</code> option - <code>multiple:</code>, <code>create:</code>, <code>create_name:</code>, <code>reorder:</code>, <code>url:</code>, <code>min_chars:</code>, <code>text:</code>, <code>selected:</code> - passes straight through from the field hash. Options come either from <code>collection:</code>, filtered in the browser, or from <code>url:</code>, fetched from an endpoint as the user types.</p>

<p class="mt-4">Unlike a bare <code>l_ui_combobox</code>, which is a multiple select by default, a combobox field infers <code>multiple:</code> from the attribute: an <code>_ids</code> attribute, or one already holding an array, is multiple, and anything else is single. A scalar attribute therefore posts a scalar rather than an array, which Active Record would cast to <code>nil</code>. Pass <code>multiple:</code> to override the inference.</p>

<p class="mt-4">Because the record's value is selected by default, an edit form needs <code>selected: [[@post.user.name, @post.user_id]]</code> whenever that value might not be among the options - a <code>url:</code> collection cannot be searched for the label of a value already set, and a <code>collection:</code> that is scoped, paginated or filtered may not contain it. Pass the selection with its label rather than widening the collection; without it, the field raises.</p>

<p class="mt-4">A combobox has no blank option, so <code>prompt:</code> and <code>include_blank:</code> raise rather than being quietly dropped when an <code>as: :select</code> field becomes <code>as: :combobox</code>. Use <code>placeholder:</code> for the text shown until something is selected.</p>

<%= l_ui_form(@post, fields: [
      { attribute: :title, required: true },
      { attribute: :user_id, as: :combobox, label: "Author",
        hint: "Start typing to filter the list",
        collection: @users.map { |u| [u.name, u.id] } },
      { attribute: :reviewer_ids, as: :combobox, label: "Reviewers",
        url: combobox_options_path, min_chars: 2 },
    ],
    url: "#") %>

<div class="mt-6" data-controller="l-ui--modal">
  <button class="l-ui-button l-ui-button--outline l-ui-button--small" data-action="l-ui--modal#open">View code</button>
  <dialog class="l-ui-modal" data-l-ui--modal-target="dialog" data-action="click->l-ui--modal#closeOnBackdrop" aria-labelledby="modal-form-combobox-heading">
    <div class="l-ui-modal__header">
      <h3 id="modal-form-combobox-heading">Combobox fields</h3>
      <button class="l-ui-button l-ui-button--icon" data-action="l-ui--modal#close" aria-label="Close">
        <%= image_tag "layered_ui/icon_close.svg", alt: "", class: "l-ui-icon l-ui-icon--sm", aria: { hidden: true } %>
      </button>
    </div>
    <div class="l-ui-modal__body">
      <pre class="l-ui-surface"><code>&lt;%= l_ui_form(@post, fields: [
      { attribute: :title, required: true },
      { attribute: :user_id, as: :combobox, label: "Author",
        hint: "Start typing to filter the list",
        collection: User.pluck(:name, :id) },
      { attribute: :reviewer_ids, as: :combobox, label: "Reviewers",
        url: options_users_path, min_chars: 2 },
      { attribute: :tag_ids, as: :combobox, label: "Tags",
        create: true, create_name: :new_tag_names,
        collection: Tag.pluck(:name, :id) },
    ],
    url: posts_path) %&gt;</code></pre>
    </div>
  </dialog>
</div>

<h2 class="mt-8 l-ui-heading--section">Options</h2>

<div class="l-ui-table-container mt-4">
  <table class="l-ui-table">
    <caption class="l-ui-sr-only">l_ui_form options</caption>
    <thead class="l-ui-table__header">
      <tr>
        <th class="l-ui-table__header-cell" scope="col">Option</th>
        <th class="l-ui-table__header-cell" scope="col">Type</th>
        <th class="l-ui-table__header-cell" scope="col">Description</th>
      </tr>
    </thead>
    <tbody class="l-ui-table__body">
      <tr>
        <th class="l-ui-table__cell l-ui-table__cell--primary" scope="row"><code>record</code></th>
        <td class="l-ui-table__cell">ActiveRecord</td>
        <td class="l-ui-table__cell">The model instance (first positional argument)</td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <th class="l-ui-table__cell l-ui-table__cell--primary" scope="row"><code>fields:</code></th>
        <td class="l-ui-table__cell">Array</td>
        <td class="l-ui-table__cell">Array of field hashes (see field options below)</td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <th class="l-ui-table__cell l-ui-table__cell--primary" scope="row"><code>url:</code></th>
        <td class="l-ui-table__cell">String</td>
        <td class="l-ui-table__cell">Form submission URL</td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <th class="l-ui-table__cell l-ui-table__cell--primary" scope="row"><code>method:</code></th>
        <td class="l-ui-table__cell">Symbol</td>
        <td class="l-ui-table__cell">HTTP method override (defaults to POST for new records, PATCH for persisted)</td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <th class="l-ui-table__cell l-ui-table__cell--primary" scope="row"><code>submit:</code></th>
        <td class="l-ui-table__cell">String</td>
        <td class="l-ui-table__cell">Submit button text (defaults to "Create" for new records, "Save" for persisted records)</td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <th class="l-ui-table__cell l-ui-table__cell--primary" scope="row"><code>multipart:</code></th>
        <td class="l-ui-table__cell">Boolean</td>
        <td class="l-ui-table__cell">Override multipart encoding. Defaults to auto-detection (true when any field is <code>:file</code>). Pass <code>true</code> or <code>false</code> to force.</td>
      </tr>
    </tbody>
  </table>
</div>

<p class="mt-4">Need more control? Override the partial by creating <code>app/views/layered/ui/managed_resource/_form.html.erb</code> in your host app, or write the form directly with <code>form_with</code> and reuse <code>layered_ui/shared/form_errors</code>, <code>layered_ui/shared/label</code>, and <code>layered_ui/shared/field_error</code>.</p>

<h2 class="mt-8 l-ui-heading--section">Field options</h2>

<div class="l-ui-table-container mt-4">
  <table class="l-ui-table">
    <caption class="l-ui-sr-only">Field options</caption>
    <thead class="l-ui-table__header">
      <tr>
        <th class="l-ui-table__header-cell" scope="col">Option</th>
        <th class="l-ui-table__header-cell" scope="col">Type</th>
        <th class="l-ui-table__header-cell" scope="col">Description</th>
      </tr>
    </thead>
    <tbody class="l-ui-table__body">
      <tr>
        <th class="l-ui-table__cell l-ui-table__cell--primary" scope="row"><code>attribute:</code></th>
        <td class="l-ui-table__cell">Symbol</td>
        <td class="l-ui-table__cell">Model attribute name (required)</td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <th class="l-ui-table__cell l-ui-table__cell--primary" scope="row"><code>as:</code></th>
        <td class="l-ui-table__cell">Symbol</td>
        <td class="l-ui-table__cell">Field type (<code>:string</code>, <code>:text</code>, <code>:email</code>, <code>:password</code>, <code>:number</code>, <code>:tel</code>, <code>:url</code>, <code>:search</code>, <code>:date</code>, <code>:datetime</code>, <code>:time</code>, <code>:month</code>, <code>:week</code>, <code>:color</code>, <code>:range</code>, <code>:file</code>, <code>:select</code>, <code>:combobox</code>, <code>:checkbox</code>, <code>:hidden</code>). Inferred from column type when omitted.</td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <th class="l-ui-table__cell l-ui-table__cell--primary" scope="row"><code>label:</code></th>
        <td class="l-ui-table__cell">String</td>
        <td class="l-ui-table__cell">Custom label text (defaults to humanised attribute name)</td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <th class="l-ui-table__cell l-ui-table__cell--primary" scope="row"><code>required:</code></th>
        <td class="l-ui-table__cell">Boolean</td>
        <td class="l-ui-table__cell">Marks field as required with a visual indicator (defaults to false)</td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <th class="l-ui-table__cell l-ui-table__cell--primary" scope="row"><code>hint:</code></th>
        <td class="l-ui-table__cell">String</td>
        <td class="l-ui-table__cell">Help text displayed below the input</td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <th class="l-ui-table__cell l-ui-table__cell--primary" scope="row"><code>placeholder:</code></th>
        <td class="l-ui-table__cell">String</td>
        <td class="l-ui-table__cell">Placeholder text for the input</td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <th class="l-ui-table__cell l-ui-table__cell--primary" scope="row"><code>collection:</code></th>
        <td class="l-ui-table__cell">Array / Proc</td>
        <td class="l-ui-table__cell">Options for <code>:select</code> and <code>:combobox</code> fields. Array of <code>[label, value]</code> pairs or a callable.</td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <th class="l-ui-table__cell l-ui-table__cell--primary" scope="row"><code>prompt:</code></th>
        <td class="l-ui-table__cell">String</td>
        <td class="l-ui-table__cell">Prompt text for <code>:select</code> fields (e.g. "Choose an author"). Shown as the first option; only selectable when no value is set. Setting <code>prompt:</code> suppresses the default blank option.</td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <th class="l-ui-table__cell l-ui-table__cell--primary" scope="row"><code>url:</code></th>
        <td class="l-ui-table__cell">String</td>
        <td class="l-ui-table__cell">For <code>:combobox</code> fields. Endpoint searched as the user types, instead of filtering a collection in the browser. Either <code>collection:</code> or <code>url:</code> is required.</td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <th class="l-ui-table__cell l-ui-table__cell--primary" scope="row"><code>include_blank:</code></th>
        <td class="l-ui-table__cell">Boolean / String</td>
        <td class="l-ui-table__cell">For <code>:select</code> fields. Defaults to <code>true</code>. Pass a string to use it as the blank option's label, or <code>false</code> to omit the blank option entirely.</td>
      </tr>
    </tbody>
  </table>
</div>
